/-! # Data header: the thirds bank parameters (lane C1L)

Generated by `scripts/claude/bank/check/emit_bank_uf.py thirds`.  The header bank `bankHead` carries the parameters
of the thirds UF bank (`P_bad = 5`, `c_Fr ≤ 25`, depth `≤ 64`, catalogue
`tableT ++ [LP1, LP2w, R, S] ++ windows ++ prefixes`) with `Λ := 0` and no templates; the per-class modules `U<j>` check their
template against it, and `AutoData` assembles the bank (`Check.Split`). -/

namespace CatalanCore.Uniform.Bank.ThirdsContent.Level3Auto
